  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "RNA contains adenine (A), guanine (g), cytosine (c) and uracil (u).\r\n\r\n(1) is cytosine, found in RNA and DNA, both.\r\n\r\n(2) is uracil, found in RNA only.\r\n\r\n(3) is thymine, found in DNA only.\r\n\r\n(4) is not a pyrimidine, i.e., nat a constituents of RNA and DNA.",
